From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: wee8 maintenance <noreply@moonbitlang.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 10:18:18 +0800
Subject: Select a native Wasm context and its implementation entries

Upstream-Status: Local runtime insertion points
Maintenance: Reconcile upstream context factories and every builtin/runtime table consumer when upgrading V8.
Tests: Context, entry-table, generated-builtin and runtime contracts.

The profile is optional; normal V8 retains its initialization and entries.
Policy and allocation sources live in custom_wee8/src, copied before GN runs.

